**/.terraform/
# .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored — commit it for
# reproducible provider version resolution.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
# Saved plan files can contain secret values in cleartext (e.g. a
# random_password result) — never committed.
*.tfplan
tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
